<title>USA: Bethlehem Steel to up sheet steel prices.</title>
<headline>Bethlehem Steel to up sheet steel prices.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bethlehem Steel Corp said on Thursday it will raise base prices for sheet steel products starting with May 4 shipments.</p>
<p>Hot rolled sheets will go up $10 per ton, cold rolled sheets will rise $12 per ton and coated sheets will increase $18 per ton, the company said.</p>
</text>
